---@class aws.elasticache.CreateServerlessCacheRequest
---@field ServerlessCacheName aws.elasticache.String User-provided identifier for the serverless cache. This parameter is stored as a lowercase string.
---@field Description? aws.elasticache.String User-provided description for the serverless cache. The default is NULL, i.e. if no description is provided then an empty string will be returned. The maximum length is 255 characters.
---@field Engine aws.elasticache.String The name of the cache engine to be used for creating the serverless cache.
---@field MajorEngineVersion? aws.elasticache.String The version of the cache engine that will be used to create the serverless cache.
